{"3586570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soaked in Sin", "steam_appid": 3586570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soaked in Sin is a anthology of 3 games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game is a collection of minigames.<br>Use the mouse for all the minigames.<br>Each game will tell you how to play in the bottom left corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game is a first person shooter with multiple bullet types.<br>Use your <strong>left and right mouse</strong> button to create different bullets. <br>Run around with <strong>WASD </strong>and <strong>shift </strong>to dash and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a 3d platformer with the goal to clean up all the trash as fast as possible.<br>Use <strong>either mouse</strong> button to pick up a trash bag and items<br>Run around with <strong>WASD</strong> and <strong>ctrl </strong>to use the broom and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soaked in Sin is a anthology of 3 games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game is a collection of minigames.<br>Use the mouse for all the minigames.<br>Each game will tell you how to play in the bottom left corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second game is a first person shooter with multiple bullet types.<br>Use your <strong>left and right mouse</strong> button to create different bullets. <br>Run around with <strong>WASD </strong>and <strong>shift </strong>to dash and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third game is a 3d platformer with the goal to clean up all the trash as fast as possible.<br>Use <strong>either mouse</strong> button to pick up a trash bag and items<br>Run around with <strong>WASD</strong> and <strong>ctrl </strong>to use the broom and <strong>space </strong>to jump.</p>", "short_description": "Jump into the imagination of Daan, a 6-yea